#: ../../source/generated/cuda.tile.grid_dependency_control_wait.rst:2
msgid "cuda.tile.grid\\_dependency\\_control\\_wait"
msgstr "cuda.tile.grid\\_dependency\\_control\\_wait"

#: cuda.tile._stub.grid_dependency_control_wait:1 of
msgid ""
"Wait for the preceding kernel in a programmatic dependent launch to "
"finish."
msgstr "在编程式依赖启动中等待前驱内核完成执行。"

#: cuda.tile._stub.grid_dependency_control_wait:3 of
msgid ""
"After the wait completes, predecessor-produced memory is visible to "
"subsequent operations in the dependent kernel."
msgstr "等待完成后，前驱内核写入的内存对依赖内核中的后续操作可见。"

